--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -2,6 +2,11 @@ Revision history for Path-Tiny
 
 {{$NEXT}}
 
+    [Bug fixes]
+
+    - Path stringification now adds "./" in front of paths starting with literal tilde
